    "chunk_text": "aliquam accusationem significat on wyll feallan sume wrohte hit getacna\u00f0. Ligatum se uidere dampnum significat gebundenne hine gesih\u00f0 hearm hit getacna\u00f0. Natare se uidere dampnum significat swimman hine geseon hearm getacna\u00fe. Oleum uidere letitiam significat ele geseon blisse getacna\u00fe. Ortum uidere dampnum significat orcyrd geseon hearm getacna\u00fe. Poma colligere molestiam significat \u00e6ppla gaderian gramam getacna\u00fe. Qui se uolare uiderit locum mutare significat se\u00fee hine fleon gesiht stowe awendan. Qui in exillio sit se uiderit magnis criminibus opprimi significat se\u00fee on wr\u00e6c gesih\u00f0 mid micelum Vuas acerbas uidere litem significat winberian sure geseon sace getacna\u00fe. Vngulas uidere angustiam significat n\u00e6gelas geseon anxsumnysse getacna\u00fe. Si somniaueris te duas lunas uidere gaudium & l\u00ebtitiam significat gif \u00feu swefnast \u00fee twege monan Si uideris quod de altissimo cadas desubtus ad pauperem bonum & ad diuitem malum significat gif \u00feu Si uideris draconem super te uolantem, thesaurum significat gif \u00feu gesihst dracan ofer \u00fee fleogende Si uideris faciem tuam pulchram gaudium significat gif \u00feu gesihst ansine \u00feine f\u00e6gere blisse getacna\u00fe. Si uideris quod in aqua pulcra intres aut ultra ambulaueris securitatem significat gif \u00feu gesihst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu Si uideris quod in aqua pulcra intres aut ambulaueris nullum bonum significat gif \u00feu gesihst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu on Si uideris quod gladio eris ciinctus securitatem signific",
